    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald McMahon are delighted to present to the market this ideally positioned four-bedroom semi-detached residence located in the mature and highly regarded Cappa Drive development, Cappa, Kilrush, Co. Clare. Enjoying an elevated setting, No. 6 commands attractive views over Kilrush Marina and the Atlantic beyond, offering a wonderful coastal backdrop.\n\nExtending to a well-proportioned layout, the accommodation on the ground floor comprises a bright front-facing living room which enjoys excellent natural light and sea views, complete with French doors opening through to the adjoining dining room. The kitchen is positioned to the rear, overlooking the private garden. A rear hallway provides access to a guest WC and internal connection to the attached garage.\n\nOn the first floor, there are four bedrooms (two double and two single) along with a main family bathroom. A converted attic space, accessed via attic stairs, provides additional space and includes a third bathroom, offering excellent flexibility for a variety of uses.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from off-street parking to the front via a private driveway, while the rear garden is mature and private, providing a peaceful outdoor space. The attached garage offers further potential, subject to the necessary consents.\n\nWhile the property would benefit from modernisation and refurbishment, it presents an excellent opportunity for purchasers to create a superb family home in a sought-after coastal location.\n\nA rare opportunity to acquire a home with exceptional potential in one of Kilrush's most established and scenic residential areas."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 3.58m x 2.15m\n\n\nLiving Room - 3.63m x 3.79m\n\n\nLiving / Dining Room - 4.14m 3.91m\n\n\nKitchen - 4.15m x 3.15m\n\n\nBack Hallway - 1.86m x 1.38m\n\n\nWC - 1.85m x 1.38m\n\n\nGarage - 6.27m x 3.14m\n\n\nUpstairs - \n\n\nBedroom 1 Single Front - 2.61m x 2.08m\n\n\nBedroom 2 Double Front - 3.67m 3.75m\n\n\nBedroom 3 Double rear - 3.42m 3.93m\n\n\nBedroom 4 Single rear - 2.27m x 3.11m\n\n\nBathroom - 1.85m x 2.09m\n\n\nConverted attic - 3.80m x 4.84m\n\n\nAttic Bathroom - 1.87m x 1.66m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
